Inter, via the @fontsource-variable/inter package

Inter, by Rasmus Andersson and the Inter Project Authors
(https://github.com/rsms/inter).

Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors.
Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://scripts.sil.org/OFL).

No woff2 is committed for this one either, for a different reason than
Satoshi's: the OFL permits redistribution, and the package is an ordinary
dependency, so `npm install` puts the subsets in place and Vite emits the ones
actually used. Both faces end up inside the built application and neither is
requested from a font host at runtime, but they arrive by different routes, one
named in `package.json` and one fetched by a script. Arriving through
node_modules rather than through this repository does not shorten the licence,
so the notice lives here with the others.

